{"id":"edcb3c1ba71c78c8","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-fo-number.md","title":"双排序数值扩张 FO(NUMBER)","display":"df-fo-number — 双排序数值扩张 FO(NUMBER)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-fo-number","aliases":["29-df-fo-number"],"display":"df-fo-number — 双排序数值扩张 FO(NUMBER)","depends_on":["[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-term]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-bit]]","[[29-df-term-interpretation]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-assignment]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 12.11, p.186, DjVu scan 201","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层已独立提取比对；本条实际核对及本地重构范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-fo-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-fo-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fo-number — 双排序数值扩张 FO(NUMBER)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f29a2487393d5b9\" href=\"?note=9f29a2487393d5b9\" title=\"29-df-bit\">29-df-bit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 12.11, p.186, DjVu scan 201"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层已独立提取比对；本条实际核对及本地重构范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，可含个体常量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq1\">\\(n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对象排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf O\">\\(\\mathsf O\\)</span> 的变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}=\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}=\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；另取与它不交的可数变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}=\\{i_j:j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}=\\{i_j:j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 作为数值排序。所有语法构造尊重排序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O}=\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O}=\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau\\)</span>；数值项只含数值变量及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{\\mathsf N},1_{\\mathsf N},\\max_{\\mathsf N}\">\\(0_{\\mathsf N},1_{\\mathsf N},\\max_{\\mathsf N}\\)</span>。两排序论域采用不交并中的带标签副本，下式用其底层坐标简写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_{\\mathsf O}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\to|A|\">\\(\\beta_{\\mathsf O}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\to|A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_{\\mathsf N}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\to N_A\">\\(\\beta_{\\mathsf N}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\to N_A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta=(\\beta_{\\mathsf O},\\beta_{\\mathsf N})\">\\(\\beta=(\\beta_{\\mathsf O},\\beta_{\\mathsf N})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 的排序在相等原子中相同。数值项解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]\">\\(u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]\\)</span> 由下式给出，域项解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}^{\\#}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathsf{At}^{\\#}_\\tau\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 遍历输入关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(R)\">\\(a(R)\\)</span> 为其元数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。满足关系按有限语法树递归；FO 布尔子句与两排序量词由本条给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\)</span> 遍历本条的NUMBER公式；所有布尔、个体全称及数值全称构造直接按下式求值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_j=i_h\\Longleftrightarrow j=h\">\\(i_j=i_h\\Longleftrightarrow j=h\\)</span>；数值变量和数值常量为独立的排序标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf v_\\#(t)\">\\(\\mathsf v_\\#(t)\\)</span> 以下式定义，域项的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{var}_\\tau\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\)</span> 按 NUMBER 语法树递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\">\\(z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_A\\coloneqq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},\\qquad 0^{A^\\#}_{\\mathsf N}\\coloneqq0,\\quad1^{A^\\#}_{\\mathsf N}\\coloneqq\\min(1,n-1),\\quad\\max^{A^\\#}_{\\mathsf N}\\coloneqq n-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_A\\coloneqq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},\\qquad 0^{A^\\#}_{\\mathsf N}\\coloneqq0,\\quad1^{A^\\#}_{\\mathsf N}\\coloneqq\\min(1,n-1),\\quad\\max^{A^\\#}_{\\mathsf N}\\coloneqq n-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{N_A}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in N_A^2\\mid i&lt;j\\},\\quad\\mathrm{BIT}_{N_A}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in N_A^2\\mid\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\},\\quad A^\\#\\coloneqq\\langle N_A,&lt;_{N_A},\\mathrm{BIT}_{N_A},0_{\\mathsf N}^{A^\\#},1_{\\mathsf N}^{A^\\#},\\max_{\\mathsf N}^{A^\\#};A\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[&lt;_{N_A}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in N_A^2\\mid i&lt;j\\},\\quad\\mathrm{BIT}_{N_A}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in N_A^2\\mid\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\},\\quad A^\\#\\coloneqq\\langle N_A,&lt;_{N_A},\\mathrm{BIT}_{N_A},0_{\\mathsf N}^{A^\\#},1_{\\mathsf N}^{A^\\#},\\max_{\\mathsf N}^{A^\\#};A\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathsf N}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\cup\\{0_{\\mathsf N},1_{\\mathsf N},\\max_{\\mathsf N}\\},\\qquad u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\beta_{\\mathsf N}(u),&amp;u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N},\\\\c^{A^\\#},&amp;u=c\\in\\{0_{\\mathsf N},1_{\\mathsf N},\\max_{\\mathsf N}\\}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathsf N}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\cup\\{0_{\\mathsf N},1_{\\mathsf N},\\max_{\\mathsf N}\\},\\qquad u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\beta_{\\mathsf N}(u),&amp;u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N},\\\\c^{A^\\#},&amp;u=c\\in\\{0_{\\mathsf N},1_{\\mathsf N},\\max_{\\mathsf N}\\}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{A^\\#,\\beta}(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t^A[\\beta_{\\mathsf O}],&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O},\\\\t^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}],&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathsf N}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_{A^\\#,\\beta}(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t^A[\\beta_{\\mathsf O}],&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O},\\\\t^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}],&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathsf N}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[a/z]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(\\beta_{\\mathsf O}[a/z],\\beta_{\\mathsf N}),&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\land a\\in|A|,\\\\(\\beta_{\\mathsf O},\\beta_{\\mathsf N}[a/z]),&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\land a\\in N_A.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[a/z]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(\\beta_{\\mathsf O}[a/z],\\beta_{\\mathsf N}),&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\land a\\in|A|,\\\\(\\beta_{\\mathsf O},\\beta_{\\mathsf N}[a/z]),&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\land a\\in N_A.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}^{\\#}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\cup\\{s=t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O}\\}\\cup\\{R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O}^{a(R)}\\}\\cup\\{u=v,u&lt;v,\\mathrm{BIT}(u,v)\\mid u,v\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathsf N}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{At}^{\\#}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\cup\\{s=t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O}\\}\\cup\\{R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O}^{a(R)}\\}\\cup\\{u=v,u&lt;v,\\mathrm{BIT}(u,v)\\mid u,v\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathsf N}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N^0_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathsf{At}^{\\#}_\\tau,\\quad\\mathcal N^{j+1}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathcal N^j_\\tau\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal N^j_\\tau,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\cup\\{Qz\\,\\phi\\mid Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\},\\  z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N},\\ \\phi\\in\\mathcal N^j_\\tau\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_j\\mathcal N^j_\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal N^0_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathsf{At}^{\\#}_\\tau,\\quad\\mathcal N^{j+1}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathcal N^j_\\tau\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal N^j_\\tau,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\cup\\{Qz\\,\\phi\\mid Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\},\\  z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N},\\ \\phi\\in\\mathcal N^j_\\tau\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_j\\mathcal N^j_\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ s=t⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\operatorname{val}_{A^\\#,\\beta}(s)=\\operatorname{val}_{A^\\#,\\beta}(t)},\\quad⟦ R(\\bar t)⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\bar t^A[\\beta_{\\mathsf O}]\\in R^A},\\quad⟦ u&lt;v⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]&lt;v^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]},\\quad⟦\\mathrm{BIT}(u,v)⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm{BIT}(u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}],v^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}])}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ s=t⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\operatorname{val}_{A^\\#,\\beta}(s)=\\operatorname{val}_{A^\\#,\\beta}(t)},\\quad⟦ R(\\bar t)⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\bar t^A[\\beta_{\\mathsf O}]\\in R^A},\\quad⟦ u&lt;v⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]&lt;v^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]},\\quad⟦\\mathrm{BIT}(u,v)⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm{BIT}(u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}],v^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}])}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq1-⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta},\\quad⟦\\phi\\land\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\min(⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta},⟦\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}),\\quad⟦\\exists z\\,\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in D_z^A}⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta[a/z]},\\quad D_z^A\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}|A|,&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O},\\\\N_A,&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq1-⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta},\\quad⟦\\phi\\land\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\min(⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta},⟦\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}),\\quad⟦\\exists z\\,\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in D_z^A}⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta[a/z]},\\quad D_z^A\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}|A|,&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O},\\\\N_A,&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A^\\#,\\beta\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A^\\#,\\beta\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\phi\\lor\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\max(⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta},⟦\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}),\\quad⟦\\phi\\to\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\max(1-⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta},⟦\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}),\\quad⟦\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq1-|⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}-⟦\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\phi\\lor\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\max(⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta},⟦\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}),\\quad⟦\\phi\\to\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\max(1-⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta},⟦\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}),\\quad⟦\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq1-|⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}-⟦\\psi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\forall z\\,\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\min_{a\\in D_z^A}⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta[a/z]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\forall z\\,\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\min_{a\\in D_z^A}⟦\\phi⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta[a/z]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta_{\\mathsf N}[a/z](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=z,\\\\\\beta_{\\mathsf N}(y),&amp;y\\neq z,\\end{cases}\\quad y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N},\\ a\\in N_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}[a/z](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=z,\\\\\\beta_{\\mathsf N}(y),&amp;y\\neq z,\\end{cases}\\quad y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N},\\ a\\in N_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\top⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq1,\\qquad⟦\\bot⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\top⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq1,\\qquad⟦\\bot⟧_{A^\\#,\\beta}\\coloneqq0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf v_\\#(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{var}_\\tau(t),&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O},\\\\\\{t\\},&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N},\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;t\\in\\{0_{\\mathsf N},1_{\\mathsf N},\\max_{\\mathsf N}\\}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf v_\\#(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{var}_\\tau(t),&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O},\\\\\\{t\\},&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N},\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;t\\in\\{0_{\\mathsf N},1_{\\mathsf N},\\max_{\\mathsf N}\\}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\top)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(s=t)\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_\\#(s)\\cup\\mathsf v_\\#(t),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(R(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathsf v_\\#(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\top)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(s=t)\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_\\#(s)\\cup\\mathsf v_\\#(t),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(R(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathsf v_\\#(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(u&lt;v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\mathrm{BIT}(u,v))\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_\\#(u)\\cup\\mathsf v_\\#(v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(u&lt;v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\mathrm{BIT}(u,v))\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_\\#(u)\\cup\\mathsf v_\\#(v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(Qz\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{z\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(Qz\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{z\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\tau]:\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\tau]:\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in|A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}}\\times N_A^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}}\\;(A^\\#,\\beta\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\phi),\\qquad\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in|A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}}\\times N_A^{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}}\\;(A^\\#,\\beta\\models_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}\\phi),\\qquad\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(NUMBER)}}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 12.11，印刷页186、扫描页201。数值域与对象域仅基数相同，不按元素相等识别；因此计数值不与任意对象域中的元素比较。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 时将数值常量1解释为0是本地退化情形约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq2\">\\(n\\geq2\\)</span> 时完全遵循原书。这里先给出NUMBER语法与语义，计数绑定器由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"73b9dab9126dbc32\" href=\"?note=73b9dab9126dbc32\" title=\"29-df-fo-count\">29-df-fo-count</a> 增加。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\forall\">\\(\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\forall\\)</span> 是本条具有独立求值子句的实际语法构造子。</p>\n<p>本轮把双排序赋值 beta 明确为两个赋值函数的有序对，并给出排序一致的统一项值及单变量赋值更新。相等原子不再调用未给出签名的混合项解释；两个排序的带标签副本仍不互相比较。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"575d9a1532e3c73b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bit","status":"resolved","id":"9f29a2487393d5b9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bit]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"76bbac386a4be5a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"76bbac386a4be5a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\beta_{\\mathsf O}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\to|A|$、$\\beta_{\\mathsf N}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\to N_A$，$\\beta=(\\beta_{\\mathsf O},\\beta_{\\mathsf N})$；$s,t$ 的排序在相等原子中相同。数值项解释 $u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]$ 由下式给出，域项解释见 [[29-df-term-interpretation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i_j=i_h\\Longleftrightarrow j=h$；数值变量和数值常量为独立的排序标签。$\\mathsf v_\\#(t)$ 以下式定义，域项的 $\\mathrm{var}_\\tau$ 取 [[29-df-free-variable]]；$\\operatorname{fv}_{\\mathrm{NUMBER}}$ 按 NUMBER 语法树递归。$z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}$，$Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}$，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-count","status":"resolved","id":"73b9dab9126dbc32","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Definition 12.11，印刷页186、扫描页201。数值域与对象域仅基数相同，不按元素相等识别；因此计数值不与任意对象域中的元素比较。$n=1$ 时将数值常量1解释为0是本地退化情形约定；$n\\geq2$ 时完全遵循原书。这里先给出NUMBER语法与语义，计数绑定器由 [[29-df-fo-count]] 增加。$\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\forall$ 是本条具有独立求值子句的实际语法构造子。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}=\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}=\\{i_j:j\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau,\\mathsf O}=\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"0_{\\mathsf N},1_{\\mathsf N},\\max_{\\mathsf N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_{\\mathsf O}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\to|A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_{\\mathsf N}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\to N_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta=(\\beta_{\\mathsf O},\\beta_{\\mathsf N})","display":false},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}^{\\#}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},